    "innovation": "This paper quantifies the rapid timeline for when and where multiple climate change-driven stressors in marine ecosystems will emerge from natural variability, demonstrating that aggressive mitigation can substantially delay their widespread onset and allow more time for ecological and socio-economic adaptation.",
